{"id":"H6439","lemma":"פְּנוּאֵל","transliteration":"penuel","sayIt":"pe-nu-EL","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Peniel","meaning":"§ Penuel or Peniel = \"facing God\"\nthe place named by Jacob when he wrestled with God and located on the north bank of the Jabbok close to the Jordan","glosses":["penuel","peniel"],"count":8,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-32","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"Peniel","kjv":"Peniel"}},{"chapterId":"gen-32","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"Penuel","kjv":"Penuel"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-8","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Penuel","kjv":"thence to Penuel"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-8","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Penuel","kjv":"of Penuel"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-8","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Penuel","kjv":"of Penuel"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-12","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Penuel","kjv":"Penuel"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Penuel","kjv":"And Penuel"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Penuel","kjv":"and Penuel"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 32:30","note":"Jacob called the name of the place Peniel; for he said, “I have seen God face to face, and my life is preserved.”","source":"web"},{"ref":"Judges 8:8","note":"He went up there to Penuel, and spoke to them in the same way; and the men of Penuel answered him as the men of Succoth had answered.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Kings 12:25","note":"Then Jeroboam built Shechem in the hill country of Ephraim, and lived in it; and he went out from there, and built Penuel.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 4:4","note":"Penuel was the father of Gedor and Ezer the father of Hushah. These are the sons of Hur, the firstborn of Ephrathah, the father of Bethlehem.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0221","lemma":"אוּרִי","transliteration":"uri","gloss":"Uri"},{"id":"H0447","lemma":"אֱלִיאֵל","transliteration":"eliel","gloss":"Eliel"},{"id":"H2147","lemma":"זִכְרִי","transliteration":"zikhri","gloss":"Zichri"},{"id":"H2354","lemma":"חוּר","transliteration":"chur","gloss":"